 "html": "\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color has-larger-font-size wp-elements-0479c23e4caee5556631ff450b09f13a\"><strong>Monopole Heidsieck antik jégveder, ezüstözött réz, ónöntvényből készült bikafejes fogantyúkkal mindkét oldalán a pezsgőház ón emblémájával.</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Az ónemblémák felirata:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Champagne Monopole Heidsieck &amp; C. &#8211; REIMS &#8211; Maison fondée en 1785</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Ez a bikafejes Monopole Heidsieck vintage pezsgőhűtő igazán különleges darab a pezsgőkedvelők gyűjteményében. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A fém rátétes antik jeges vedrek nagyon népszerűek a gyűjtők körében, s ezek közül is kiemelkedően keresett a bikafejes változat. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>Ezt a fogantyúformát volt a legnehezebb elkészíteni és felszerelni, ezért mindig kevés készült belőlük.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Ezt a korai Art Deco pezsgőhűtőt az 1930-as évek körül, a párizsi ARGIT cég készítette. Ez egy modèle déposé / regisztrált modell, és a hűtő aljén ARGIT bélyegzővel és az ezüstműves mesterjellel is el van látva.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-3 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Az ezüstözése 100 év alatt szinte teljesen lekopott. Alján kisebb horpadások, de nem zavaróak.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Jelen állapotában a kopottas rézvedren látható fém részletek különös eleganciát és klasszikus stílust kölcsönöznek ennek az egyedi pezsgős vedernek.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-4 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Vannak olyanok, akik ezeket az antik darabokat felújítják és újraezüstözik. Mi ezzel az irányzattal nem értünk egyet.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Ez a pezsgős jégveder jelen állapotában is tökéletes választás bármilyen különleges alkalomra, vagy akár egyedi dekorációs elemként is megállja a helyét.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Nemcsak praktikus, hanem esztétikailag is lenyűgöző, amely garantáltan felkelti mindenki figyelmét.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-5 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-6 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-7 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>ChampagneClub Budapest – „A buborékok eltűnnek, a pezsgő tartozékok megmaradnak.”</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://champagnemania.com/\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>ChampagneClub Budapest – „Bubbles Fade Accessories Stay”</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-8 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right has-larger-font-size\"><strong>Antique Monopole Heidsieck ice bucket with pewter cast bull&#8217;s head handles and coat of arms shields on both sides</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color has-larger-font-size wp-elements-7373ff751afc9f7e6047cc6ac94cd78f\">Monopole Heidsieck antique ice bucket, silver-plated copper, with cast tin bull head handles on both sides featuring the champagne house&#8217;s tin emblem.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The inscriptions on the tin emblems read:</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Champagne Monopole Heidsieck &amp; C. &#8211; REIMS &#8211; Maison fondée en 1785</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-9 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-10 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>This bull-headed Monopole Heidsieck vintage ice bucket is a truly special piece for champagne enthusiasts. Metal appliqué antique ice buckets are very popular among collectors, and the bull-headed version is exceptionally sought after. This handle design was the most difficult to create and attach, which is why only a few were made.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>This early Art Deco champagne cooler was made around the 1930s by the Parisian company ARGIT. It is a modèle déposé / registered model, and is stamped with the ARGIT mark and the silversmith&#8217;s hallmark on the bottom.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-11 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The silver plating has almost completely worn off over the past 100 years. There are minor dents at the bottom, but they are not distracting.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>In its current state, the worn copper bucket with visible metal details lends a special elegance and classic style to this unique champagne bucket.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>There are those who restore and re-silver these antique pieces. We do not agree with this trend.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-12 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>This champagne ice bucket is a perfect choice for any special occasion in its current condition, or it can also serve as a unique decorative element.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>It is not only practical but also aesthetically stunning, guaranteed to catch everyone&#8217;s attention.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Old used product in excellent vintage condition.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-larger-font-size\"><strong>Similar Champagne Monopole Heidsieck &amp; C. vintage champagne ice buckets</strong>:</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-13 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://sursumvivere.hu/\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-larger-font-size\"><strong>Fémbútorok gyártása Budapesten. Egyedi megrendelésre készítünk beltéri és kültéri fémbútorokat és lakberendezési tárgyakat.</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Manufacture of metal furniture in Budapest. We create custom-made indoor and outdoor metal furniture and home decor items.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right has-regular-font-size\"><strong><a href=\"https://sursumvivere.hu/\">www.sursumvivere.hu</a></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-14 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://sursumvivere.hu/\"></a></figure>\n",
